# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A pattern box as a CLIP window: the analyser renders full frame, the box
# keeps everything below row 8 so the top of the sky stays clear, and it is
# ADDED over the aurora (black between the bars lets the curtains through),
# ramped from blue through pink to white. Music-reactive with a sensor feed;
# without one the analyser plays its built-in demo groove. Designed at 64x64
# (`U 64 64`), so the clear band is the top eighth of any panel.
S - Spectrum over Aurora
U 64 64
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 80 none fill 1
N Aurora
I @pat/aurora-2d
L pat 0 8 0 0 add 100 none fill 1
N Spectrum
I @pat/sound-spectrum-analyser
C sliderBands 524288
R 100 0:000000 120:2b7fff 220:ff4fd8 255:ffffff
